# Env and secrets

- Real values live in `.env` (gitignored). Document keys only in `.env.example`.
- After adding a variable: update `.env.example`, `src/config/env.ts`, and `.env` locally.
- Never commit `.env`, credentials, or Nest Observe keys.
- Ollama defaults to `http://127.0.0.1:11434`. Do not assume a cloud LLM provider.
- Nest Observe stays off when `NEST_OBSERVE_APP_KEY` or `NEST_OBSERVE_APP_SECRET` is empty.
